2.   Segment specifications

     Change indicators

     a plus sign (+)    for an addition
     an asterisk (*)    for an amendment to structure
     a hash sign (#)    for changes to names
     a vertical bar (|) for changes to text for functional
                        descriptions or notes
     a letter X (X)     for marked for deletion

       BGM  BEGINNING OF MESSAGE

       Function: To indicate the type and function of a message.

010    C002 DOCUMENT/MESSAGE NAME                     C    1
020    1004 DOCUMENT IDENTIFIER                       C    1 an..35

       DTM  DATE/TIME/PERIOD

       Function: To specify date/time/period.

010    C507 DATE/TIME/PERIOD                           C    1

       RFF  REFERENCE

       Function: To specify a reference.

010    C506 REFERENCE                                  M    1
